<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto my-6 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl">
  <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-5 mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight" data-i18n="nav_manual">Enterprise User Manual & Standard Procedures</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Operational handbook for citizens, vetted commercial bidders, and administrative government officers.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 text-sm">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-amber-400 mr-2"></i> 1. Account Roles & Security Authorization
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>Citizen / Public:</strong> Instant search without credentials. Access transparent location-specific execution data across states, districts, taluks, and villages.</li>
        <li><strong>Commercial Bidder:</strong> Submit detailed bids on open tenders. Access your comprehensive historical bidding logs, track won awards, and download digitally stamped contract certificates.</li>
        <li><strong>Government Official:</strong> Manage the tender lifecycle from publishing, bid evaluation, contractor assignment, live stage updates, and account vetting.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button text-indigo-400 mr-2"></i> 2. Progressive Web App (PWA) Mobile & Desktop Installation
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        This platform includes a built-in Progressive Web App (PWA). Click the <strong>Download App</strong> button on the top navigation bar or select <em>Add to Home Screen</em> / <em>Install App</em> from your browser options on Chrome, Edge, Safari (iOS), or Android to use it as a native standalone application.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf text-emerald-400 mr-2"></i> 3. Contract Generation & Verification
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        When a tender status transitions to <strong>Assigned</strong>, the awarded contractor receives instantaneous access to download an official government PDF contract containing project IDs, GST details, locations, and legal terms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
